description:
closes #299

@simonpcouch Do you think it would be useful to keep these methods around? Or be less swift with the deprecation?

We don't seem to have missed them when they broke and all they do is save you one step of extracting the parameter set from the workflow. But we could also stash them in {workflows} if you think they are worth keeping.

closes #180 

a new parameter object for the rolling summary statistic used in `recipes::step_window()` 

@topepo I used `summary_stat` as the name because that's what was [already laid out in the recipes code](https://github.com/tidymodels/recipes/blob/72a44a99c1db616bdf974496cc9f74066c79a861/R/window.R#L291) but am open to a different name if anything has changed since this got put into recipes.
